Aapke liye Master Prompts taiyaar hain jinhe aap copy-paste karke use kar sakte hain:

1. The "Master Prompt" (Sabse Best & Complete Template)
Jab aapke paas koi complex code ya statistical topic ho, toh yeh prompt use karein:

text


Mujhe is code/topic ka ek dam deep, step-by-step first-principles explanation chahiye:
1. Concrete Data Trace: Abstract formulas se pehle, actual NumPy array/numbers ke form mein dikhao ki shuruat mein data kaisa dikhta hai aur har function ke baad array ke andar numbers kaise badalte hain.
2. Math + Origin: Har formula (jaise constants ya values) ka mathematical origin explain karo ki yeh number kahan se aaya, sirf formula mat likhna.
3. Intuition & Analogy: Ek simple real-world analogy (jaise exam marks, courier delays, etc.) se intuition clear karo.
4. Confusion Buster: Isme sabse bada trap/misconception kya hota hai jahan log confuse hote hain, use alag se highlight karo.
5. Visual Logic: Graph/Plot ke zariye dikhao ki kaunsa data kahan baitha hai aur kaunse patterns highlight ya hide ho rahe hain.
Bhasha: Simple Hinglish (Technical terms intact rakhte hue).
