3. Machine Learning / Math Formula ke liye Specialized Prompt
Jab code nahi, balki koi theory ya formula samajhna ho (jaise IQR, PCA, Gradient Descent, P-value):

text


Mujhe is concept ka "No-Jargon, High-Rigor" breakdown chahiye:
1. Iska mathematical derivation kya hai aur iske constants (jaise 1.57, 1.96, etc.) kahan se aaye?
2. Agar mere paas 5-10 numbers ka ek chhota sample array ho, toh hand-calculation karke dikhao.
3. Industry/Clinical/Production scenario mein yeh kyu use hota hai aur standard methods (like Mean/t-test) yahan kyu fail ho jaate hain?
💡 Pro-Tip: Yeh 4 "Power Words" hamesha use karein
Jab bhi aap kisi AI model se baat karein, prompt mein in words ko zaroor shamil karein:

"Concrete data trace" 
→
→ Model ko abstract baatein chhod kar actual numbers dikhane par majboor karta hai.
"First-principles explanation" 
→
→ Model basic fundamental facts se start karke step-by-step logic build karta hai.
"Origin of constants" 
→
→ Model sirf formula chipkane ke bajaye batata hai ki number kahan se derive hua.
"Common misconceptions" 
→
→ Jo confusion aapke dimag mein aa sakta hai, wo pehle hi clear ho jaata hai.
